# ---------------------------------------------------------------- art: first step, fork go_on (cycle s1)

== the first piece turned away
tier: life event
shape: art
kind: plateau
rungs: 0
fork: go_on
stages: child juvenile young_adult adult mature elder
age: 8-90
per_year: 0 0 0 0 0 0
tone: trouble
life: interests, inner
horizon: months
roles: mentor, friend, parent
earth: the first piece {N} put forward has been turned away, and the next open call closes in two weeks
tribal: the first song {N} offered at the fire was passed over, and the next gathering is soon
magic: the first work {N} offered to the tower's audience was refused, and the next sitting is near
scene: The first piece {N} has ever put forward, for a show, an audition or a call for work, has been turned away with a short polite note. The next open call closes in two weeks, and {N} has to decide whether to try again, try differently, or let it rest.
scene tribal: The first song {N} offered at the fire was passed over for an older singer's, and nobody said why. The next gathering is at the full moon.
scene magic: The first work {N} offered to the tower's audience came back with the steward's seal and a single line of refusal. The next sitting opens before the month is out.
- W | read the call's rules again, and send the next piece exactly as asked | v: conformity, achievement | aim: work | foot: lesson read the rules first | chance: 75
- U | ask the ones who said no what would have made it a yes | v: self-direction, achievement | aim: work | foot: person mentor | chance: 65
- B | send it somewhere bigger, to prove the first lot wrong | v: power, achievement | aim: work | foot: mark took a wild risk | chance: 50
- R | make something new and bolder for the next call, straight away | v: stimulation, self-direction | aim: work | foot: lesson new work answers best | chance: 70
- G | keep making things for friends and family, and skip the calls for a while | v: benevolence, security | aim: later | foot: means ties+.03 | chance: 90
- W>U | keep a file of every piece sent and every answer, and learn from the pattern | v: conformity, self-direction | aim: work | foot: mark learned a skill | chance: 80
- U>B | study the pieces that were taken, and work out what they had | v: self-direction, achievement | aim: work | foot: lesson see what gets chosen | chance: 75
- B>R | stop sending work out, and make things only for the fun of it | v: achievement, hedonism | aim: ease | foot: means freedom+.03 | chance: 88
- R>G | let it go for good, and keep the friends made at the first show | v: stimulation, benevolence | aim: stop | foot: person friend | chance: 90
- G>W | stop for now, and keep the habit of looking closely that it gave | v: tradition, universalism | aim: stop | foot: lesson looking closely is kept | chance: 88
works: The sting fades within a week, and {N} can think about the work again, not the note.
works: The choice settles, and {N} finds the refusal taught more than a yes would have.
fails: The refusal stays sore longer than {N} expected.
fails: Whatever was chosen, {N} reads the short note again more than once.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- art: first step, fork go_on (cycle s2)

== when practice stops being new
tier: life event
shape: art
kind: plateau
rungs: 0
fork: go_on
stages: child juvenile young_adult adult mature elder
age: 8-85
per_year: 0 0 0 0 0 0
tone: mixed
life: interests, family
horizon: months
roles: mentor, parent, friend
earth: the novelty of {aim.doing} has worn off, practice feels like a chore, and the next block of lessons needs booking
tribal: the first delight in {aim.doing} has faded, and the old one who teaches it asks whether {N} will keep learning
magic: the wonder of the first lessons in {aim.doing} has faded, and the master's next term must be asked for
scene: The first months of {aim.doing} were all delight. Now the delight has gone quiet: practice is something to be reminded about, and the pieces are harder and slower. The next block of lessons has to be booked by the end of the month.
scene tribal: The first delight in {aim.doing} has faded, and {N} has started finding other things to do when the old one who teaches it calls. Before the next moon the old one will ask straight out whether {N} wants to keep learning.
scene magic: The wonder of the first lessons has worn off, and the practice room in the tower feels long and cold. The master's next term begins at the new moon, and novices must ask to be kept on.
- W | book the next block, and keep a set time each day for practice | v: conformity, security | aim: work | foot: mark kept your word | chance: 80
- U | ask the teacher for pieces that are hard in a new way | v: self-direction, stimulation | aim: work | foot: person teacher | chance: 75
- B | set a goal: one piece played or shown in public before the year is out | v: achievement, power | aim: work | foot: lesson a goal pulls hard | chance: 65
- R | drop the set pieces, and play or make whatever comes, for a month | v: hedonism, stimulation | aim: later | foot: means freedom+.03 | chance: 88
- G | stop the lessons, and keep {aim.doing} as a small thing at home | v: security, benevolence | aim: ease | foot: means ties+.03 | chance: 90
- W>B | book the lessons, and practise with a chart until it is habit again | v: conformity, achievement | aim: work | foot: mark learned a skill | chance: 75
- U>R | find a group to do it with, so it stops being a lonely hour | v: self-direction, stimulation | aim: work | foot: place gather.circle | chance: 75
- B>G | stop for good, and keep the ear and the hands it trained | v: achievement, security | aim: stop | foot: mark learned a skill | chance: 88
- R>W | stop, and spend the hours helping at the school's or the street's shows | v: stimulation, universalism | aim: stop | foot: mark helped someone in need | chance: 85
- G>U | take a term off, and come back to it if it is missed | v: security, self-direction | aim: ease | foot: lesson missing it tells the truth | chance: 88
works: A month on, the choice sits right, and the nagging about practice has stopped.
works: {N} feels lighter for having decided, instead of drifting.
fails: The chore feeling lingers whichever way it went.
fails: The decision keeps getting reopened at home for a few weeks.

