# ---------------------------------------------------------------- knowledge: first step, fork go_on (cycle s1)

== the chapter that will not go in
tier: life event
shape: knowledge
kind: plateau
rungs: 0
fork: go_on
stages: child juvenile young_adult adult mature elder
age: 9-90
per_year: 0 0 0 0 0 0
tone: mixed
life: learning, inner
horizon: months
roles: teacher, friend, parent
earth: the first truly hard part of {aim.doing} will not make sense, and the first test is two weeks away
tribal: the first hard teaching of {aim.thing} will not stay in {Ns} head, and the old one will ask it back soon
magic: the first hard text of {aim.thing} will not open its sense, and the masters' questioning is two weeks off
scene: The easy start of {aim.doing} is over. The first truly hard part has arrived, and it will not go in, however many times {N} goes back to it. The first test is two weeks off, and every other way of spending those hours is starting to look much more appealing.
scene tribal: The old one has taught the first hard part of {aim.thing}, and it will not stay in {Ns} head. At the next moon the old one will ask it back, before the whole band.
scene magic: The first hard text the masters set will not give up its sense, however long {N} sits over it by the lamp. The masters' questioning is two weeks away.
- W | go back to the start of the hard part, and work through it in order | v: conformity, achievement | aim: work | foot: mark learned a skill | chance: 75
- U | find a different explanation of the same thing, from another book or teacher | v: self-direction, achievement | aim: work | foot: lesson another way in exists | chance: 75
- B | ask the cleverest one in the group to explain it, and trade help for help | v: achievement, power | aim: work | foot: lesson help is worth trading | chance: 70
- R | skip ahead to the parts that are fun, and come back to it later | v: stimulation, hedonism | aim: later | foot: means freedom+.03 | chance: 85
- G | stop here, and keep the curiosity for reading in a gentler way | v: security, benevolence | aim: stop | foot: lesson curiosity does not need tests | chance: 88
- W>U | ask the teacher for extra time after the lesson, and bring every question | v: conformity, self-direction | aim: work | foot: person teacher | chance: 80
- U>B | let it go, and keep the habit of hard thinking for something else | v: self-direction, achievement | aim: stop | foot: lesson hard thinking travels well | chance: 85
- B>R | sit the test anyway, and use whatever comes back as a map | v: power, stimulation | aim: work | foot: mark took a wild risk | chance: 60
- R>G | study it with a friend, out loud, until it makes sense to both | v: stimulation, benevolence | aim: work | foot: person friend | chance: 80
- G>W | slow down, take the test next time round, and learn it properly | v: security, conformity | aim: ease | foot: means health+.02 | chance: 85
works: Somewhere in the second week the hard part turns over and shows its sense, or stops mattering so much.
works: The choice is made, and the study hours stop feeling like a held breath.
fails: The hard part stays hard, and {N} goes into the next weeks unsure.
fails: The choice is right on paper, but it takes a while to feel right.

