tribal: the first time the old one tested {N} on {aim.thing}, half the answers were wrong, and the next teaching is soon
magic: the first set work for the masters came back marked poor, and the next term's names are being taken
scene: The first marked piece of work has come back, and the mark is poor. Not a disaster, but well below what {N} hoped. The names for the next part of the course have to be in by the end of the month.
scene tribal: The first time the old one tested {N} on {aim.thing} before the others, half the answers were wrong. The next teaching begins at the new moon, for those who come.
scene magic: The first set work came back from the masters with a poor mark and a few dry words in the margin. The next term's names are being taken now.
- W | read every comment, put each one right, and hand the work in again anyway | v: conformity, achievement | aim: work | foot: mark learned a skill | chance: 80
- U | work out which mistakes were understanding and which were carelessness | v: self-direction, achievement | aim: work | foot: lesson know which mistake it was | chance: 80
- B | go on to the next part, and set out to beat the top mark | v: achievement, power | aim: work | foot: person rival | chance: 55
- R | change the way of studying completely: new hours, new place, new method | v: stimulation, self-direction | aim: work | foot: place learn.keeping | chance: 70
- G | stop the course, and keep the subject as something to read about at leisure | v: security, tradition | aim: stop | foot: lesson interest outlives the marks | chance: 90
- W>B | ask the teacher what a good mark looks like, then work to that | v: conformity, achievement | aim: work | foot: person teacher | chance: 75
- U>R | let it go, and take the method it taught to a subject that fits better | v: self-direction, stimulation | aim: stop | foot: mark learned a skill | chance: 85
- B>G | go on, but take the next part more slowly, over two terms instead of one | v: achievement, security | aim: ease | foot: means time+.04 | chance: 85
- R>W | go on, and start a study group for the others who did badly too | v: stimulation, universalism | aim: work | foot: mark helped someone in need | chance: 75
- G>U | put the next part off a term, and read around the subject meanwhile | v: security, self-direction | aim: later | foot: means health+.02 | chance: 88
works: The poor mark turns out to be a useful map, whichever way {N} goes from here.
works: A few weeks on, the mark has shrunk to its real size, and {N} can see past it.
fails: The mark stings longer than it should, and {N} keeps doubting the choice.
fails: Nothing feels clearer for a while; the next weeks are slow and uncertain.

