tier: life event
shape: venture
kind: plateau
rungs: 0
fork: go_on
stages: juvenile young_adult adult mature elder
age: 16-80
per_year: 0 0 0 0 0 0
tone: trouble
life: travel, friends
horizon: months
roles: friend, mentor, parent
earth: the first real outing of {aim.doing} went hard, cold and lost and frightened, and the next one is booked for next month
tribal: the first far journey {N} made went hard, and the others are already planning the next
magic: the first journey with the guild's company went hard, and the next one leaves soon
scene: The first real outing of {aim.doing} went hard: the weather turned, the way was lost for an hour, and {N} was more frightened than {N} let on. Everyone got home safe. The next trip is booked for next month, and {friend} wants to know if {N} is still in.
scene tribal: The first far journey {N} made went hard: the river was high, the nights were cold, and for a day the way was lost. The others are already planning the next, and want to know if {N} will come.
scene magic: The first journey with the guild's company went hard: a storm on the pass, a lost day, a night in the open. The company leaves again within the month, and the roll is open.
- W | go again, after a proper course on safety and finding the way | v: security, conformity | aim: work | foot: mark learned a skill | chance: 80
- U | go over what went wrong with the group, and change the plan | v: self-direction, security | aim: work | foot: lesson the weak point shows | chance: 80
- B | go again, and lead this time, to be sure it is done right | v: power, achievement | aim: work | foot: lesson leading weighs more | chance: 55
- R | go again straight away, before the fear has time to set | v: stimulation, self-direction | aim: work | foot: mark took a wild risk | chance: 60
- G | stay home this time, and go next season when it feels right | v: security, benevolence | aim: later | foot: means health+.03 | chance: 90
- W>U | go again on an easier route, and build up from there step by step | v: conformity, self-direction | aim: ease | foot: lesson easier first, then harder | chance: 85
- U>B | stop, and keep the hard-won knack for reading weather and maps | v: self-direction, achievement | aim: stop | foot: mark learned a skill | chance: 88
- B>R | go again, with better gear and a harder route to prove the point | v: achievement, stimulation | aim: work | foot: means money-.04 | chance: 50
- R>G | let it go, and keep the friends made on that hard first trip | v: stimulation, benevolence | aim: stop | foot: person friend | chance: 90
- G>W | go again, but only with the seasoned group that looks after newcomers | v: benevolence, security | aim: work | foot: place gather.circle | chance: 80
works: The fright shrinks to a story, and {N} tells it with a grin by the end of the month.
works: The choice holds, and the memory of the hard day settles into something useful.
fails: The fright comes back at odd moments for a while, whichever way it went.
fails: The decision is made, but {N} keeps second-guessing it until the trip has come and gone.

