earth: the first big trip of {aim.doing} is planned, and the deposit is due on Monday
tribal: the first long journey is planned, and the family must give up a share of the stores for it
magic: the first long journey is planned, and the guild's fee for a place in the company is due within the week
scene: After a season of small outings, the first big trip of {aim.doing} is planned: weeks away, a long way off, the real thing. The deposit is due on Monday. It is a lot of money for {N}, and once it is paid the trip is real.
scene tribal: After a season of short journeys, the first long one is planned: a whole moon's walk to the far side of the hills. The family must give up a share of the stores for it before the band leaves.
scene magic: After a season of short journeys, a place in the guild's company for the long road over the mountains is open. It costs a year's savings, and the fee is due within the week.
- W | pay the deposit from savings set aside for it, and plan every day | v: security, conformity | aim: work | foot: means money-.06 | chance: 85
- U | find a cheaper way to do the same trip, and pay for that | v: self-direction, security | aim: work | foot: lesson cheaper is not worse | chance: 75
- B | pay, and stretch it into a longer, bigger trip than planned | v: achievement, power | aim: work | foot: means money-.10 | chance: 55
- R | pay tonight, before there is time to think better of it | v: stimulation, hedonism | aim: work | foot: mark took a wild risk | chance: 65
- G | put the big trip off a year, and keep the small outings close to home | v: security, benevolence | aim: later | foot: means ties+.03 | chance: 90
- W>B | pay, and take extra work to cover it before leaving | v: conformity, achievement | aim: work | foot: means time-.05 | chance: 70
- U>R | let the deposit go, and spend the money learning a new skill instead | v: self-direction, stimulation | aim: stop | foot: mark learned a skill | chance: 85
- B>G | ask the family to help with the deposit, and promise to bring them along next time | v: power, benevolence | aim: work | foot: person parent | chance: 70
- R>W | stop the plans, and put the saved money toward what the household needs | v: self-direction, universalism | aim: stop | foot: lesson the road will wait | chance: 88
- G>U | take a shorter trip this year instead, and learn from that first | v: security, self-direction | aim: ease | foot: lesson short trips teach first | chance: 85
works: The money question is settled, and the trip, or the staying, feels like {Ns} own choice.
works: A week on, the choice sits right, and {N} stops checking the figures.
fails: The money is tighter than {N} admitted, and the strain shows for a while.
fails: Whatever was chosen, {N} keeps wondering about the other way for a few weeks.
